    {
      "key": "case_study_detail_28224860229f",
      "text": "Jeff knew that legacy methods—like cold sales visits—were no longer enough. It was time to build a modern search experience that brought customers to DEUTZ online, 24/7.\n\nDEUTZ had already worked with a digital agency—but the partnership fell short. Traffic stagnated, leads were minimal, and there was little strategic follow-through. Jeff needed a partner who would take ownership and deliver results.",
